    "text": "By FOX6 News Digital Team ,\n10 hours ago GREENDALE, Wis. - New video from the Greendale Police Department shows the moment an officer’s squad slammed into a light pole in Franklin during a pursuit over the summer. What started as a routine traffic stop quickly escalated when the driver took off, sending the officer speeding through the streets in pursuit. But the chase came to a sudden halt. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
